/*
================================================================================
VELOCITY X - Master Material: M_Foliage_Bark_Master
Asset Path: /Game/Materials/Vegetation/M_Foliage_Bark_Master
Target Use: Tree trunks, heavy branches for highway perimeter forest

PBR SPECIFICATION & PARAMETER REGISTRY:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. BASE COLOR (Albedo):
   - Param "Bark_Tint" (LinearColor, Default=(0.22, 0.18, 0.15, 1.0)):
     Weathered pine / oak bark.
   - Param "Moss_Tint" (LinearColor, Default=(0.18, 0.28, 0.07, 1.0)):
     Northern exposure moss overlay.
   - Param "Moss_Coverage" (Scalar, Default=0.45):
     Driven by World Normal Dot Vector(0, 1, 0) for directional growth.

2. ROUGHNESS & NORMAL:
   - Param "Roughness_Bark" (Scalar, Default=0.88): Porous organic wood.
   - Param "Roughness_Moss" (Scalar, Default=0.72): Soft velvety moss.
   - Param "Normal_Depth_Scale" (Scalar, Default=1.4): Deep furrows and bark cracks.

3. WIND DISPLACEMENT:
   - Integrates MF_WindAnimation with height mask (Z > 50cm) to flex trunk naturally.
================================================================================
*/
